      "content": "wait, if it's just imaging/camera gain, why does the log show the deceleration event occurring even when the sensor data is clean? it almost looks like the car is acting on its own. i'm worried we might have a systemic glitch rather than just noise. if we have to pull the X-2s for a full diagnostic, it's gonna be a nightmare for our uptime targets today. is there any chance this is actually a software-level error in the braking logic?",
